sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor E as Staff (CMS)
  participant A as FastAPI
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant W as Worker
  participant N as Next.js
  participant X as Webhooks / AI index
  E->>A: POST /admin/projects/{id}/publish
  A->>A: Permission check, RERA number + QR present, no sample flag in production
  A->>DB: one transaction: publish_state, audit_log, outbox(project.published)
  A-->>E: 200
  W->>DB: claim event
  W->>N: POST /_internal/revalidate (signed) tags: project:slug, projects, sitemap
  N-->>W: 200, pages rebuilt on next request
  W->>X: webhooks, knowledge index refresh (Phase 7)
